                                "id": 14,
                                "field": "source_text",
                                "start": 1529,
                                "end": 1824,
                                "text": "A person treated as an employer under paragraph (3) shall not be treated as an employer with respect to wages paid for any service other than domestic service referred to in paragraph (3) unless such person is treated as an employer under paragraph (1) or (2) with respect to such other service."
                              },
